MOLAN-AV3A
Copyright 2026 MOLAN-AV3A contributors

This repository packages the AVS3-P3 (Audio Vivid) reference decoder.

===========================================================================
Upstream code (src/, excluding src/api/)
===========================================================================

AVS3-P3 reference software, version AVS3A_RMv3.3.1
("信息技术 智能媒体编码 第3部分：沉浸式音频 第一阶段（广电/流媒体Profile）参考编解码器")

  Copyright 2023 HUAWEI TECHNOLOGIES CO., LTD.
  Licensed under the Code Sharing Policy of the UHD World Association (UWA)
  http://www.theuwa.com/UWA_Code_Sharing_Policy.pdf

  you may not use this file except in compliance with the Policy.
  Unless agreed to in writing, software distributed under the Policy is
  distributed on an "AS IS" BASIS, WITHOUT WARRANTIES OF ANY KIND, either
  express or implied. See the Policy for the specific language governing
  permissions and limitations under the Policy.

  The upstream copyright/license header block is retained at the top of
  every upstream file. The upstream ReadMe (AVS3A_RMv3.3.1) notes that the
  version is intended for end-to-end integration and testing of the
  "百城千屏" (City-Screen) initiative; a newer version may be published by
  UWA later.

  Provenance: the upstream sources were obtained from a public mirror of
  the reference decoder (github.com/zlxyc/Sourcecodeforplayer, commit
  e7d244d29454eb04c968cd98a30587303a9c15f8), after the original
  distribution location became unavailable. Files under the upstream
  `avs3Encoder/` tree and IDE/build artifacts are not included.

===========================================================================
Modifications introduced by this repository (marked in-context where
practical):
===========================================================================

  src/avs3Decoder/src/decoder.c
    - the upstream CLI main() is compiled out unless AVS3_NO_MAIN is
      undefined (the library target defines AVS3_NO_MAIN=1);
    - one stray debug printf() next to an commented-out ASLOG call is
      inert in library builds (printf is redirected at compile time).

  src/avs3Decoder/include/Version.h
    - the per-OS version-info function block duplicated for two platforms
      collided on non-Windows targets and has been reduced to no-ops.

  All other upstream files are unmodified.

===========================================================================
This repository's own code
===========================================================================

  include/molan_av3a.h, src/api/molan_av3a.c, cli/, CMakeLists.txt,
  .github/workflows/
    - public API wrapper, MP4/M4A demuxer, WAV writer, CLI, build system;
      provided under the same UWA Code Sharing Policy terms as the
      upstream code for interoperability.
